      "description": "Spacecraft (S/C) magnetic stray fields at ASM sensor position",
      "descriptionType": "SeriesInformation"
    },
    {
      "description": "The ASMxAUX_1B Product contains detailed information on the S/C magnetic stray fields and the Sun induced stray field at the ASM sensor position. The data are provided at 50 Hz at the time-instants of the VFM measurements (for internal practical purposes); the stray field vectors are provided in the ASM sensor frame.",
